  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhance BR management capacities, BR functioning, S-S Cooperation, N-S Cooperation, and advocate for the establishment of new Biosphere Reserves with a special view to Member States that do not yet have any BRs, such as Bangladesh, Bhutan and Nepal.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Produce South &amp; Central Asian advocacy publication on Biosphere Reserves &apos;Pockets of hope&apos;. 2. Cross-border seminars Bangladesh/India (the Sundarbans) towards BR establishment. 3. Support Bhutan&apos;s Lamperi Park as a new BR. 4. Support SS cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
